Package: kernova-branding
Architecture: all
Section: kde
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, breeze, kf6-breeze-icon-theme, plasma-workspace-data
Description: KERNOVA identity, Plasma color scheme and Parallax wallpaper
 Installs the KERNOVA product information, original mark and wallpaper, and
 the Night global theme for Plasma 6. The theme uses KDE's Breeze controls.

Package: kernova-default-settings
Architecture: all
Section: kde
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, kernova-branding (= ${binary:Version})
Description: initial desktop settings for new KERNOVA accounts
 Seeds the global theme and file associations when an account is created.
 Includes a read-only diagnostic command for checking a running session.

Package: kernova-welcome
Architecture: all
Section: kde
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, qt6-svg-plugins, kernova-performance (= ${binary:Version}), kernova-branding (= ${binary:Version})
Description: offline native introduction and system information for KERNOVA
 Helps desktop users get started, personalize the desktop and find help.
 Uses the ordinary account and the installed system's settings tools.

