Package: kernova-performance
Architecture: all
Section: kde
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, apt
Suggests: power-profiles-daemon, plasma-discover
Description: Smart Performance Center and system updates for KERNOVA
 Launch a workload with Gaming, Coding, Battery Saver or Maximum Performance
 scheduling. Supported hardware power profiles last for the workload lifetime.
 Review package versions and history and open Discover to install updates.
